<h3><strong>StayEase</strong> - Full-Stack Rental Web Application</h3>
<p>StayEase is a <em>full-stack Airbnb-inspired platform</em> that
enables users to register, log in, and list or browse rental properties.
The backend is built with <strong>Node.js</strong> and
<strong>Express</strong>, while <strong>MongoDB</strong> handles data
persistence. Dynamic pages are rendered using <strong>EJS
templates</strong>, and sessions are securely managed using
<strong>cookies</strong>. The project is designed for both development and
production environment configuration.</p>
<h3><strong>Interactive Tic-Tac-Toe Game</strong></h3>
<p>Built a responsive Tic-Tac-Toe game using <strong>HTML5</strong>,
<strong>CSS</strong>, and <strong>JavaScript</strong>. Implementing
win/draw logic through game-based pattern checks and move history
tracking. Added features like <em>undo moves</em> and <em>real-time winner
detection</em> while maintaining clean, performant code architecture.</p>
